function gfLogMs(w){const d=String(w?.date||w?.completedAt||'').slice(0,10);return /^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(d)?new Date(d+'T12:00:00').getTime():NaN}
function gfTrainingComparisonWindows(){const logs=(progress?.workoutLogs||[]).filter(w=>w?.completed!==false&&Number.isFinite(gfLogMs(w))).sort((a,b)=>gfLogMs(a)-gfLogMs(b));if(!logs.length)return null;const first=gfLogMs(logs[0]),last=gfLogMs(logs.at(-1)),day=86400000,range=Math.max(1,Math.round((last-first)/day)+1),win=range>=42?28:Math.max(7,Math.floor(range/2));return {baseStart:first,baseEnd:first+(win-1)*day,recentStart:last-(win-1)*day,recentEnd:last,days:win}}
function gfMuscleTrainingStats(startMs,endMs){
  const out=Object.fromEntries(GF_DEV_KEYS.map(k=>[k,{sets:0,reps:0,strengthNumerator:0,strengthDenominator:0}])),exerciseBest={};
  for(const w of (progress?.workoutLogs||[])){const ms=gfLogMs(w);if(!Number.isFinite(ms)||ms<startMs||ms>endMs||w?.completed===false)continue;const entries=Array.isArray(w.setEntries)?w.setEntries:[];
    if(entries.length){for(const set of entries){const name=set.exerciseName||set.name||set.exerciseKey||'',weights=exerciseMuscleWeights({name,focus:set.focus||''}),reps=Math.max(0,Number(set.reps)||0),score=e1RM(set.weightKg,set.reps),ek=String(set.exerciseKey||name).toLowerCase();for(const [k,wt] of Object.entries(weights)){if(!out[k])continue;out[k].sets+=wt;out[k].reps+=reps*wt}if(score>0){if(!exerciseBest[ek]||score>exerciseBest[ek].score)exerciseBest[ek]={score,name,weights}}}
    }else for(const ex of (w.exercises||[])){const weights=exerciseMuscleWeights(ex),sets=Math.max(0,Number(ex.sets)||0);for(const [k,wt] of Object.entries(weights)){if(out[k])out[k].sets+=sets*wt}}
  }
  for(const e of Object.values(exerciseBest))for(const [k,wt] of Object.entries(e.weights||{})){if(!out[k])continue;out[k].strengthNumerator+=e.score*wt;out[k].strengthDenominator+=wt}
  for(const k of GF_DEV_KEYS){out[k].conditioning=out[k].sets*8+out[k].reps;out[k].strength=out[k].strengthDenominator?out[k].strengthNumerator/out[k].strengthDenominator:null}
  return out
}
function gfPctDelta(cur,base){cur=Number(cur);base=Number(base);if(!Number.isFinite(cur)||!Number.isFinite(base)||base<=0)return null;return (cur/base-1)*100}
function gfVisualAnalysisPoints(){
  const reviews=[...(progress?.weeklyCheckins||[])].filter(x=>x?.analysis).sort((a,b)=>String(a.date||'').localeCompare(String(b.date||''))),baseline=progress?.baselineAnalysis||reviews[0]?.analysis||null,latest=reviews.at(-1)||null;
  const baseAnalysis=baseline,curAnalysis=latest?.analysis||baseline,baseWeight=Number(baseAnalysis?.bodyWeightKg)||Number(plan?.client?.startWeightKg)||0,curWeight=Number(latest?.weightKg)||Number(curAnalysis?.bodyWeightKg)||Number(latestWeight())||baseWeight,startWeight=Number(plan?.client?.startWeightKg)||baseWeight||1;
  return {baseAnalysis,curAnalysis,baseWeight,curWeight,startWeight}
}
function gfDevelopmentStats(){
  const wins=gfTrainingComparisonWindows(),base=wins?gfMuscleTrainingStats(wins.baseStart,wins.baseEnd):null,recent=wins?gfMuscleTrainingStats(wins.recentStart,wins.recentEnd):null,visual=gfVisualAnalysisPoints(),bd=gfMassDistributionFromAnalysis(visual.baseAnalysis),cd=gfMassDistributionFromAnalysis(visual.curAnalysis),out={conditioning:{},strength:{},mass:{},windows:wins,visual};
  for(const k of GF_DEV_KEYS){const b=base?.[k],c=recent?.[k];out.conditioning[k]={base:b?.conditioning??null,current:c?.conditioning??null,delta:gfPctDelta(c?.conditioning,b?.conditioning),baseSets:b?.sets??null,currentSets:c?.sets??null,baseReps:b?.reps??null,currentReps:c?.reps??null};out.strength[k]={base:b?.strength??null,current:c?.strength??null,delta:gfPctDelta(c?.strength,b?.strength)};
    const bs=bd?.shares?.[k],cs=cd?.shares?.[k],baseTotal=visual.startWeight?visual.baseWeight/visual.startWeight*100:100,curTotal=visual.startWeight?visual.curWeight/visual.startWeight*100:100,bi=Number.isFinite(bs)?bs/100*baseTotal:null,ci=Number.isFinite(cs)?cs/100*curTotal:null;out.mass[k]={base:bi,current:ci,delta:gfPctDelta(ci,bi),share:Number.isFinite(cs)?cs:null,baseShare:Number.isFinite(bs)?bs:null,coverage:cd?.visibleTotal??null}}
  return out
}
function gfDevelopmentColor(delta){if(!Number.isFinite(delta))return 'rgb(38 58 82)';const d=clamp(delta,-25,60);if(d<0){const u=(d+25)/25;return `rgb(${Math.round(52-16*u)} ${Math.round(78-24*u)} ${Math.round(132-44*u)})`}const stops=[[0,[28,52,76]],[12,[44,168,201]],[30,[255,210,100]],[60,[255,123,69]]];let a=stops[0],b=stops.at(-1);for(let i=1;i<stops.length;i++)if(d<=stops[i][0]){a=stops[i-1];b=stops[i];break}const u=(d-a[0])/Math.max(.001,b[0]-a[0]),rgb=a[1].map((v,i)=>Math.round(v+(b[1][i]-v)*u));return `rgb(${rgb[0]} ${rgb[1]} ${rgb[2]})`}
function gfDevelopmentSVG(view,mode,stats){let svg=bodyMapSVG(view);svg=svg.replace(/id="muscleMap"/g,'').replace(/id="zone-[^"]+"/g,'').replace(/showMuscleDetail\(/g,'gfShowDevelopmentMuscleDetail(');svg=svg.replace(/(<g class="zone"[^>]*data-muscle="([^"]+)"[^>]*style="--zone-fill:)[^"]+("[^>]*>)/g,(m,a,k,c)=>`${a}${gfDevelopmentColor(stats?.[mode]?.[k]?.delta)}${c}`);return svg.replace('muscle-map ',`muscle-map development-muscle-map `)}
function gfDevelopmentModeCopy(mode){return mode==='conditioning'?'Work-capacity change from weighted working sets and reps':mode==='strength'?'Change in average estimated 1RM signal from logged weighted sets':'Perceived visual-mass index change from comparable physique analysis'}
function gfDevelopmentDetailHTML(k,mode,stats){const d=stats?.[mode]?.[k]||{},delta=Number(d.delta),goal=gfGoalFocusMuscles().includes(k),cls=Number.isFinite(delta)?(delta>=0?'pos':'neg'):'na',deltaText=Number.isFinite(delta)?`${delta>=0?'+':''}${Math.round(delta)}%`:'N/A';let kpis='';if(mode==='conditioning')kpis=`<div><span>Baseline</span><b>${Number.isFinite(d.baseSets)?round(d.baseSets,1)+' sets':'—'}</b></div><div><span>Recent</span><b>${Number.isFinite(d.currentSets)?round(d.currentSets,1)+' sets':'—'}</b></div><div><span>Recent reps</span><b>${Number.isFinite(d.currentReps)?Math.round(d.currentReps):'—'}</b></div>`;else if(mode==='strength')kpis=`<div><span>Baseline e1RM</span><b>${Number.isFinite(d.base)?Math.round(d.base)+' kg':'—'}</b></div><div><span>Recent e1RM</span><b>${Number.isFinite(d.current)?Math.round(d.current)+' kg':'—'}</b></div><div><span>Signal</span><b>${Number.isFinite(delta)?'Compared':'Need data'}</b></div>`;else kpis=`<div><span>Visual share</span><b>${Number.isFinite(d.share)?d.share.toFixed(1)+'%':'N/A'}</b></div><div><span>Start index</span><b>${Number.isFinite(d.base)?d.base.toFixed(1):'—'}</b></div><div><span>Current index</span><b>${Number.isFinite(d.current)?d.current.toFixed(1):'—'}</b></div>`;return `<div class="gf-development-detail"><div class="gf-development-detail-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">Selected muscle${goal?' · Goal focus':''}</div><h4>${esc(gfDevLabel(k))}</h4><p>${esc(gfDevelopmentModeCopy(mode))}</p></div><div class="gf-development-delta ${cls}">${deltaText}</div></div><div class="gf-development-kpis">${kpis}</div></div>`}
function gfDevelopmentMapMountHTML(){const stats=gfDevelopmentStats(),focus=gfGoalFocusMuscles(),goalText=focus.length?focus.map(gfDevLabel):[(plan?.goal?.focus||[])[0]||'Overall development'];return `<div class="gf-development-tabs"><button class="${gfDevelopmentMode==='conditioning'?'on':''}" onclick="gfSetDevelopmentMode('conditioning')">Conditioning</button><button class="${gfDevelopmentMode==='strength'?'on':''}" onclick="gfSetDevelopmentMode('strength')">Strength</button><button class="${gfDevelopmentMode==='mass'?'on':''}" onclick="gfSetDevelopmentMode('mass')">Visual mass</button></div><div class="gf-goal-focus-row">${goalText.map(x=>`<span>Goal · ${esc(x)}</span>`).join('')}</div><div class="gf-development-grid"><div class="gf-development-stage"><div class="bodyviz-label">Front</div>${gfDevelopmentSVG('front',gfDevelopmentMode,stats)}</div><div class="gf-development-stage"><div class="bodyviz-label">Back</div>${gfDevelopmentSVG('back',gfDevelopmentMode,stats)}</div></div><div class="gf-development-legend"><span>Lower</span><div class="gf-development-gradient"></div><span>Greater increase</span></div>${gfDevelopmentDetailHTML(gfDevelopmentSelected,gfDevelopmentMode,stats)}`}
function gfDevelopmentCardHTML(){return `<section class="card glass gf-development-card" id="gfDevelopmentCard"><div class="gf-development-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Development map</div><h3>What is actually improving?</h3><p>Compare work capacity, estimated strength and analyser-perceived mass against your baseline.</p></div><span class="gf-goal-chip">Goal-linked</span></div><div id="gfDevelopmentMapMount">${gfDevelopmentMapMountHTML()}</div></section>`}
function gfSetDevelopmentMode(mode){if(!['conditioning','strength','mass'].includes(mode))return;gfDevelopmentMode=mode;const m=document.getElementById('gfDevelopmentMapMount');if(m)m.innerHTML=gfDevelopmentMapMountHTML()}
function gfShowDevelopmentMuscleDetail(k){gfDevelopmentSelected=k;const m=document.getElementById('gfDevelopmentMapMount');if(m)m.innerHTML=gfDevelopmentMapMountHTML()}

// Make the numeric goal a real part of the weight graph, extending projection to the goal date.
drawWeightChart=function(){
  const el=document.getElementById('weightChart');if(!el)return;const {actual}=buildWeightSeries();if(actual.length<1){el.innerHTML='<div class="muted" style="padding:82px 20px;text-align:center">Add a weigh-in to unlock the goal trajectory.</div>';return}
  const first=actual[0].date,last=actual.at(-1).date,goalDate=gfGoalDateISO(),end=[last,goalDate].sort().at(-1),goal=Number(plan?.goal?.targetWeightKg)||actual.at(-1).value,projectionDates=[...new Set([...actual.map(x=>x.date),goalDate])].sort(),projected=projectionDates.map(date=>({date,value:projectedWeightOn(date)})),goalLine=[{date:first,value:goal},{date:end,value:goal}];
  el.innerHTML=buildLineChartSVG({series:[{label:'Actual',color:'#9ad6ff',points:actual,strokeWidth:3.5},{label:'Projected',color:'#8d80ff',points:projected,strokeWidth:2.4,dash:'7 7'},{label:`Goal ${round(goal,1)} kg`,color:'#ffd36c',points:goalLine,strokeWidth:1.8,dash:'3 6'}],legend:[{label:'Actual',color:'#9ad6ff'},{label:'Projected',color:'#8d80ff',dash:'7 7'},{label:`Goal ${round(goal,1)} kg`,color:'#ffd36c',dash:'3 6'}],yLabel:'Bodyweight (kg)',yTickFormatter:v=>`${round(v,1)}`,emptyText:'No weight data yet'});
};

// Add the development map and explicit goal value without rebuilding the established Analysis page.
const gfRenderProgressV4024Base=renderProgress;
renderProgress=function(){gfRenderProgressV4024Base.apply(this,arguments);const root=document.getElementById('progress');if(!root)return;const goal=Number(plan?.goal?.targetWeightKg)||Number(latestWeight())||0,heroStats=root.querySelectorAll('.analysis-stat');if(heroStats[0])heroStats[0].innerHTML=`<span>Goal weight</span><b>${round(goal,1)} kg</b>`;const weightCard=[...root.querySelectorAll('.analysis-card')].find(x=>x.querySelector('#weightChart'));if(weightCard){const small=weightCard.querySelector('.section .small');if(small)small.textContent=`Actual vs projected · goal ${round(goal,1)} kg`;if(!weightCard.querySelector('.gf-weight-goal-note'))weightCard.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<div class="gf-weight-goal-note"><span>Projected goal date</span><b>${esc(longDateLabel(gfGoalDateISO()))}</b></div>`)}root.querySelector('#gfDevelopmentCard')?.remove();const loadMap=root.querySelector('.progress-muscle-card');if(loadMap)loadMap.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend',gfDevelopmentCardHTML());else{const hist=root.querySelector('.history-divider');if(hist)hist.insertAdjacentHTML('beforebegin',gfDevelopmentCardHTML())}setTimeout(()=>{drawWeightChart();const m=document.getElementById('gfDevelopmentMapMount');if(m)m.innerHTML=gfDevelopmentMapMountHTML()},0)};

